  "slug": "the-big-moon",
  "title": "Review: The Big Moon’s headlining return sonically soars at Fleece",
  "content": "<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"148\" height=\"26\" class=\"size-full wp-image-12059 alignleft\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/10/4-stars.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><em>27th February 2020</em></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"5760\" height=\"3840\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-14122\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/BW8A5883.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/BW8A5883.jpg 5760w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/BW8A5883-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/BW8A5883-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/BW8A5883-675x450.jpg 675w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 5760px) 100vw, 5760px\" /></p>\n<p>Fresh from completing their supporting role on Bombay Bicycle Club&#8217;s recent UK tour, in addition to a series of dates in support of Pixies during their European dates in 2019, tonight&#8217;s sold out show is The Big Moon&#8217;s first headline performance for nigh on two years. Despite any nerves or challenges that may arise after such a haitus between headline shows &#8211; tonight, for instance, we hear debut airings from recently released sophomore record <em>Walking Like We Do &#8211; </em>these support slots have evidently fashioned the London four-piece into a dynamic, well-honed indie rock unit.</p>\n\n\t\t<style type=\"text/css\">\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 {\n\t\t\t\tmargin: auto;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 .gallery-item {\n\t\t\t\tfloat: left;\n\t\t\t\tmargin-top: 10px;\n\t\t\t\ttext-align: center;\n\t\t\t\twidth: 33%;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 img {\n\t\t\t\tborder: 2px solid #cfcfcf;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 .gallery-caption {\n\t\t\t\tmargin-left: 0;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t/* see gallery_shortcode() in wp-includes/media.php */\n\t\t</style>\n\t\t<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-14118 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.thefixmagazine.com/the-big-moon/bw8a5877-2/#main'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/BW8A5877-1-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/BW8A5877-1-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/BW8A5877-1-45x45.jpg 45w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.thefixmagazine.com/the-big-moon/bw8a5875/#main'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/BW8A5875-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/BW8A5875-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/BW8A5875-45x45.jpg 45w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.thefixmagazine.com/the-big-moon/bw8a5940/#main'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/BW8A5940-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/BW8A5940-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/BW8A5940-45x45.jpg 45w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><br style=\"clear: both\" /><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\